  "body": "## Goal\n\nUse the native Agie post on more common stock thicknesses with the supported wire and resident technology. The first Classic Cut 2S post qualifies one 20 mm QN2 case.\n\n## Work\n\nQualify additional thicknesses with the same wire, material, quality and separation settings. Measure each thickness separately in the offline control. Pass the actual work height to both the piece and its work. Check the stock and wire clearance against the largest measured pass offset for the selected thickness. Refuse an unqualified height or technology setting.\n\nDone means: Original synthetic cases pass formal and graphical checks. Native tests cover the selected heights, margins and refusal between qualified cases. The operator guide states which thicknesses and technology settings have evidence.\n\nDepends on #2945.\n",
